{"name":"日式侘寂","description":"侘寂风是一种用自然材料、留白和不对称表达时间与不完美的视觉风格 · 它常见于家居、器物、旅宿和慢阅读页面，会使用低刺激色彩、材料肌理与手工细节放慢节奏。它不等同于某个品牌，也不是米白配宋体的固定模板。","quote":"素一点、旧一点、留白多一点，有种安静的时间感。","agentPrompt":"","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-style-wabisabi\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>日式侘寂<span>Wabi-sabi</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">素一点、旧一点、留白多一点，有种安静的时间感。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">侘寂风是一种用自然材料、留白和不对称表达时间与不完美的视觉风格</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>它常见于家居、器物、旅宿和慢阅读页面，会使用低刺激色彩、材料肌理与手工细节放慢节奏。它不等同于某个品牌，也不是米白配宋体的固定模板。</span></div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"dh-demo style-detail-demo\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"风格示例，可横向滚动\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"style-detail-canvas\"><div class=\"style-wabisabi-demo style-wabisabi-journal\"><div class=\"wb-head\"><b>一席茶事</b><span>五月 · 雨水</span><i>第 04 则</i></div><div class=\"wb-page\"><aside>午后<br>雨停<br>器温<br>微凉</aside><main><small>今日所用 / 粗陶茶碗</small><h2>先闻香，<br>再等水开。</h2><p>壶口冒出第一缕白气时，院里只剩一声很轻的鸟鸣。茶不急着喝，先让杯壁暖一暖手。</p><div class=\"wb-meta\"><span>焙火乌龙 · 3 泡</span><b>续写此刻 →</b></div></main><div class=\"wb-vessel\"><i></i><span>手捏<br>茶碗</span></div></div><span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\">茶</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"principles-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">设计原则 · Principles</div><div class=\"usage-box use principles-box\"><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">从真实材料和摄影中提取自然、低刺激的色板</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用留白放慢阅读节奏，但具体比例由内容决定</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">字体选择服务于内容，中英文分别检查字距与可读性</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">通过轻微不对称建立平衡，不让布局失去重心</div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">纸张、陶土等肌理只作辅助，不能干扰正文</div></li></ul></div></section><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">家居和器物品牌，突出材料与手工过程</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;background:#f5f2ea;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:2px\">素色床品 · 棉麻四件套</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;margin-top:4px\">家居品牌官网可使用克制的材料与排版</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">茶、香和手作商品，内容节奏较慢</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"width:100%;background:#f5f2ea;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:2px\">手作粗陶茶杯 · 一只一窑</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;margin-top:4px\">茶 / 香 / 器物电商</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">旅宿页面，呈现空间、材料与停留感</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29\">山里的温泉旅馆 · 房态以实际页面为准</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">民宿预订页可用安静的视觉节奏呈现空间</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">散文和个人博客，重视长文阅读体验</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29\">「秋日备忘录」· 散文集</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">个人博客与长文阅读</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">数据密集工具为了氛围牺牲扫描效率</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">数据大盘：多张图表 + 实时刷新 KPI</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">任务密集场景应优先保证扫描效率</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">高饱和颜色没有明确职责，破坏安静层级</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;background:#f5f2ea;border:1px solid #ddd\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">+</span><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;background:#ff2a6d\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只有大面积空白，却缺少排版和材质细节</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div style=\"width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">只有一行字 + 纯白底,没有内容关系</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--red);margin-top:4px\">留白应帮助阅读或展示材料，而不是替代信息</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">促销标签过多，打断整体阅读节奏</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">限时 5 折</span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">爆款</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">新品</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"paper\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.1) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:4px 4px;color:#8a8577\">米白纸底</span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"ink\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:4px\"><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#a8a294\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#5b564c\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#2e2d29\"></i></span></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"serif\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;,serif;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:3px\">衬线</span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"ma\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:2px;background:#2e2d29\"></span></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"asym\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea;position:relative\"><i style=\"position:absolute;top:6px;left:8px;width:12px;height:2px;background:#2e2d29\"></i><i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;right:8px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#b8452f;border-radius:1px\"></i></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"seal\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;font-size:12px\">侘</span></span></span>\n    </span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"paper\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">纸感底色</span><span class=\"pe\">Paper Base</span></button><span class=\"pd\">示例用带细颗粒的米白色，需检查纹理不会干扰文字</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"ink\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">自然色层级</span><span class=\"pe\">Earth &amp; Ink</span></button><span class=\"pd\">从产品、摄影和品牌中提取颜色，同时为正文与状态保留足够对比</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"serif\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">衬线排版</span><span class=\"pe\">Serif</span></button><span class=\"pd\">衬线字体和字距可增强阅读节奏，中文正文须以清晰易读为先</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"ma\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">间 · 留白</span><span class=\"pe\">Ma</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用空白控制节奏和关系，具体比例由内容和屏幕决定</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"asym\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">5</span><span class=\"pn\">不对称平衡</span><span class=\"pe\">Asymmetry</span></button><span class=\"pd\">用内容、留白和对齐关系建立平衡，不强制特定位置</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"seal\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">6</span><span class=\"pn\">朱红点缀</span><span class=\"pe\">Accent</span></button><span class=\"pd\">高饱和点缀可以承担落款或关键强调，但不要求全页只能使用一次</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"prompt-section prompt-section-dialogue\"><div class=\"section-title\">AI 提示词 · Prompt</div><div class=\"prompt-box prompt-box-dialogue\"><blockquote><p>做一个手作茶器品牌的内容页，记录器物、泡茶过程和作者笔记。让材料、照片和留白带出安静节奏，同时保持正文、价格和下一步操作易读。材料、照片、价格和文字只用现有资料，缺少的先标“待补充”，不要自行编造。</p></blockquote><button type=\"button\" class=\"prompt-copy\" aria-label=\"复制\" title=\"复制\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">茶事仪式日志</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"茶事仪式日志\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div class=\"style-wabisabi-scene\"><div class=\"wb-scene-head\"><b>一 席 茶 事</b><span>五月 · 雨水</span><i>第 04 则</i></div><div class=\"wb-scene-body\"><aside>午后<br>雨停<br>器温<br>微凉</aside><main><small>今日所用 / 粗陶茶碗</small><h3>先闻香，<br>再等水开。</h3><p>雨停后泡一壶焙火乌龙。先让杯壁暖一暖手，再把第一口留给安静。</p><div><span>焙火乌龙 · 3 泡</span><b>续写此刻 →</b></div></main><figure><i></i><span>手捏<br>茶碗</span></figure></div><em class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\">茶</em></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">家居品牌官网</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"家居品牌官网\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.05) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:5px 5px;font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;,serif\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">素 然</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;letter-spacing:2px\">家具 · 织物 · 器物 · 关于</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:30px;padding:34px 34px 30px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:8px\">生活,素之然也</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:22px;letter-spacing:6px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">棉麻四件套</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2.1;margin:14px 0 18px\">未漂染的棉,亚麻的骨。<br>洗过三次,才到最好的时候。</p>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#33322e;border-bottom:1px solid #33322e;padding-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:2px\">查看细节 →</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">价格以实际页面为准</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:110px;height:110px;flex:none;background:#e9e4d8;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #ddd6c6\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">织物</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">茶器物电商页</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"茶器物电商页\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;,serif;padding:22px 30px 18px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">一 间 茶 事</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">春 · 器物上新</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">粗陶茶杯 · 一只一窑</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">库存以实际页面为准</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">价格待补充</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">白瓷公道杯</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">现货</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">价格待补充</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">竹制茶则 · 老竹</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">现货</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">价格待补充</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">每件附作者手写卡片</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">茶</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">温泉旅馆预订页</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"温泉旅馆预订页\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;,serif;padding:24px 28px;position:relative\">\n      <div style=\"height:74px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#dfe3d8,#c9cfc0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;letter-spacing:3px\">山间 · 晨雾</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">雾 见 温 泉</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2;margin:10px 0 16px\">海拔八百米,只有八间房。<br>泉水引自山腹,四季恒温。</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2;font-size:12px;color:#5b564c\">\n        <span>7.26 入住</span><span>7.28 离店</span><span style=\"color:#a8a294\">2 位</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577\">价格与房态以实际页面为准</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f5f2ea;background:#2e2d29;padding:7px 18px;letter-spacing:3px\">预订</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">散文博客文章页</div><p class=\"style-demo-scroll-hint\">左右滑动查看完整示例</p><div class=\"scene-shot is-browser is-style-scene\"><div class=\"sc-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class=\"sc-url\"></span></div><div class=\"sc-body\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"散文博客文章页\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:&#x27;Songti SC&#x27;,&#x27;Noto Serif SC&#x27;,serif;padding:26px 34px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:14px\">散文 · 秋日备忘录</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">柿 子 熟 了</div>\n      <div style=\"width:34px;height:1px;background:#a8a294;margin:18px 0\"></div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px\">院里的柿子树是搬来那年种下的。头三年只长叶,第四年忽然挂了果,青转橙,橙转红,谁也不催它。</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:14px\">邻人路过,说该摘了。我说再等等,等霜打过,甜味才肯沉下来。</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:22px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">甲辰年 · 霜降</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">记</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/style-wabisabi","markdown":"# 日式侘寂Wabi-sabi\n\n你可能会说\n素一点、旧一点、留白多一点，有种安静的时间感。\n\n**侘寂风是一种用自然材料、留白和不对称表达时间与不完美的视觉风格**·它常见于家居、器物、旅宿和慢阅读页面，会使用低刺激色彩、材料肌理与手工细节放慢节奏。它不等同于某个品牌，也不是米白配宋体的固定模板。\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n设计原则 · Principles\n\n- 从真实材料和摄影中提取自然、低刺激的色板\n- 用留白放慢阅读节奏，但具体比例由内容决定\n- 字体选择服务于内容，中英文分别检查字距与可读性\n- 通过轻微不对称建立平衡，不让布局失去重心\n- 纸张、陶土等肌理只作辅助，不能干扰正文\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- 家居和器物品牌，突出材料与手工过程\n\n素色床品 · 棉麻四件套家居品牌官网可使用克制的材料与排版\n- 茶、香和手作商品，内容节奏较慢\n\n手作粗陶茶杯 · 一只一窑茶 / 香 / 器物电商\n- 旅宿页面，呈现空间、材料与停留感\n\n山里的温泉旅馆 · 房态以实际页面为准民宿预订页可用安静的视觉节奏呈现空间\n- 散文和个人博客，重视长文阅读体验\n\n「秋日备忘录」· 散文集个人博客与长文阅读\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 数据密集工具为了氛围牺牲扫描效率\n\n数据大盘：多张图表 + 实时刷新 KPI任务密集场景应优先保证扫描效率\n- 高饱和颜色没有明确职责，破坏安静层级\n\n+\n- 只有大面积空白，却缺少排版和材质细节\n\n只有一行字 + 纯白底,没有内容关系留白应帮助阅读或展示材料，而不是替代信息\n- 促销标签过多，打断整体阅读节奏\n\n限时 5 折爆款新品\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n米白纸底+\n      +\n      衬线+\n      +\n      +\n      侘\n\n1纸感底色Paper Base示例用带细颗粒的米白色，需检查纹理不会干扰文字\n\n2自然色层级Earth & Ink从产品、摄影和品牌中提取颜色，同时为正文与状态保留足够对比\n\n3衬线排版Serif衬线字体和字距可增强阅读节奏，中文正文须以清晰易读为先\n\n4间 · 留白Ma用空白控制节奏和关系，具体比例由内容和屏幕决定\n\n5不对称平衡Asymmetry用内容、留白和对齐关系建立平衡，不强制特定位置\n\n6朱红点缀Accent高饱和点缀可以承担落款或关键强调，但不要求全页只能使用一次\n\nAI 提示词 · Prompt\n\n> 做一个手作茶器品牌的内容页，记录器物、泡茶过程和作者笔记。让材料、照片和留白带出安静节奏，同时保持正文、价格和下一步操作易读。材料、照片、价格和文字只用现有资料，缺少的先标“待补充”，不要自行编造。\n\n典型使用场景\n\n茶事仪式日志\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n**一 席 茶 事**五月 · 雨水第 04 则\n\n午后\n雨停\n器温\n微凉今日所用 / 粗陶茶碗\n\n### 先闻香，\n再等水开。\n\n雨停后泡一壶焙火乌龙。先让杯壁暖一暖手，再把第一口留给安静。\n\n焙火乌龙 · 3 泡**续写此刻 →**\n手捏\n茶碗\n茶\n\n家居品牌官网\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n**素 然**\n        家具 · 织物 · 器物 · 关于\n\n      \n生活,素之然也\n\n        \n棉麻四件套\n\n          \n未漂染的棉,亚麻的骨。\n洗过三次,才到最好的时候。\n\n          \n查看细节 →\n            价格以实际页面为准\n\n        \n织物\n\n茶器物电商页\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n**一 间 茶 事**\n        春 · 器物上新\n\n      \n粗陶茶杯 · 一只一窑\n        库存以实际页面为准\n        价格待补充\n\n      \n白瓷公道杯\n        现货\n        价格待补充\n\n      \n竹制茶则 · 老竹\n        现货\n        价格待补充\n\n      \n每件附作者手写卡片\n        茶\n\n温泉旅馆预订页\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n山间 · 晨雾\n\n      \n雾 见 温 泉\n\n      \n海拔八百米,只有八间房。\n泉水引自山腹,四季恒温。\n\n      \n7.26 入住7.28 离店2 位\n\n      \n价格与房态以实际页面为准\n        预订\n\n散文博客文章页\n\n左右滑动查看完整示例\n\n散文 · 秋日备忘录\n\n      \n柿 子 熟 了\n\n      \n\n      \n院里的柿子树是搬来那年种下的。头三年只长叶,第四年忽然挂了果,青转橙,橙转红,谁也不催它。\n\n      \n邻人路过,说该摘了。我说再等等,等霜打过,甜味才肯沉下来。\n\n      \n甲辰年 · 霜降\n        记"}